{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Idle?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed as a school project in Python. It's all about buying computers and letting them mine crypto. With that crypto, you can hire assassins, level up augmentations, fill your wallet, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each difficulty level introduces new features to help you progress. For example: <strong>Augmentations</strong> \u2014 these allow you to level specific aspects of the game to boost your progress speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s the theme of the game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game isn\u2019t based on a specific theme at the start, as you climb through the higher difficulty levels, the atmosphere begins to shift, giving off a more mysterious vibe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Any inspirations from existing games?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes! The hand-drawn art style and some game mechanics are inspired by <strong>4G's NGU IDLE</strong>. I think NGU is one of the best games in the idle/incremental genre, and it served as a big inspiration for this project.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Equip a PC and start mining!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629460/extras/859849d9867ebf808d0c6d4aee28334d.avif?t=1766330315\" width=796 height=594 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can Buy PCs, Boosters, Upgrades and much more to increase your mining speed and get rich!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629460/extras/5f05e917cd339b1a0100f648543fb0d3.avif?t=1766330315\" width=796 height=596 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock achievements to ascend to a higher difficulty and unlock more features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629460/extras/e127199f9b09a24b1f5c7265b347c879.avif?t=1766330315\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebirth to increase your multiplier on almost everything!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629460/extras/27a4271b30d38ece944f3488f69ea2ef.avif?t=1766330315\" width=798 height=598 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Once you unlock higher difficulties, you will be able to use new features related to that difficulty.</strong> There will be new 'Stuff' buttons related to your difficulty on the main menu.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629460/extras/ce6345ce5660fdbee6b43b54f6aa9471.avif?t=1766330315\" width=796 height=594 /></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629460/997dc4b18df3571676bfc82ffec32776e24d5c87.jpg"},{"name":"Feeling rich yet?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629460/85eba52de2d53e315846dd3e63062e969c352644.jpg"},{"name":"Getting closer to freedom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629460/4ef00761b9a5a6e7afe52ead34903f44c4ca0d1e.jpg"},{"name":"Crypto Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629460/ef1dc4cdc13dfe33342b56535ae63915fa3a1b3e.jpg"},{"name":"Crypto Entrepreneur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629460/dae76db3d4236db6a75adc76cf4eca2dd88ab51c.jpg"},{"na